<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE MODIFIES CATEGORY DESCRIPTION.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE MODIFIES CATEGORY DESCRIPTION.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said it has renamed the two share categories, in harmony with the most recent modifications of its trading and introduction rules.</p>
<p>According to this the listed and traded categories will be called &quot;listed A&quot; and &quot;listed B&quot;, the BSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
